Package: bsimms
Title: Bayesian Stable Isotope Mixing Models using 'Stan'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mattia", "Ghilardi", , "mattia.ghilardi91@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9592-7252"))
Description: Fits Bayesian stable isotope mixing models (SIMMs) via
    'Stan', estimating the proportional contribution of two or more
    sources to a mixture from tracer data such as stable isotopes.
    Supports the core modelling options of the 'JAGS'-based package
    'MixSIAR' (raw or summarised source and trophic discrimination factor
    data, concentration dependence, flexible error structures), and
    extends them by allowing source proportions to depend on an arbitrary
    'lme4'-style fixed- and random-effects formula of mixture-level
    covariates.
